# Keep the risc0 reproducible-guest-build Docker context small and
# deterministic. risc0-build copies the whole workspace root (the guest's
# path deps live at ../../crypto and ../../private_multisig_core, so the
# build context must be the repo root) — without this, multi-GB target/
# dirs and local state would be shipped into the build image, making the
# build slow and the image-id sensitive to local artifacts.
target/
**/target/
.git/
